# Sample requests for the VS / VS Code / Rider HTTP client.
@api = http://localhost:5080/api/v1

### Sign in with the demo owner (development only)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hassan@demo.kira", "password": "Demo12345!" }

### Who am I
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
GET {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health
GET http://localhost:5080/health/ready
